@startuml
title SensibLaw / Legal Governance -> DASHI TOE normalization

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Existing theorem owners" {
  [AuthorityNonPromotionCore] as Authority
  [AuthorityBoundaryCore] as Boundary
  [SensibLawSemanticPromotionPolicy] as Semantic
  [SensibLawAgdaFirstLegalRuntimeEverything] as Legal
  [SensibLawITIRParityEverything] as Parity
  [DomainPermeabilityAuthorityTransport] as Domain
  [SnowballAttributionProvenanceInvariantExact] as Snowball
  [SensibLawSnowballAttributionLineageAdapterExact] as SnowballLineage
  [SensibLawParetoProofDirectedCorpusSearchEverything] as Pareto
}

package "Normalization" {
  [SensibLawGovernanceTOEExact] as GovTOE
}

package "TOE facades" {
  [EverythingTOESymmetryResolved369] as Root
  [Unifier] as Unifier
  [Unified.Physics] as Physics
}

package "Regression" {
  [SensibLawGovernanceTOEValidation] as Validation
  [Unified.Everything] as UnifiedEverything
}

Authority --> Boundary : fail-closed authority bundle
Authority --> Semantic : authority non-promotion
Legal --> Parity : legal runtime contract
Semantic --> GovTOE : semantic non-promotion
Boundary --> GovTOE : legal authority boundary
Legal --> GovTOE : runtime firewalls
Parity --> GovTOE : invariant handoff
Domain --> GovTOE : case-management authority transport
Snowball --> SnowballLineage : source-role attribution
Snowball --> GovTOE : citation proof/authority firewall
SnowballLineage --> GovTOE : legal claim-stage separation
Pareto --> GovTOE : scheduling is not legal authority

GovTOE --> Root : normalized exports
GovTOE --> Unifier : normalized exports
GovTOE --> Physics : normalized exports

Root --> Validation
Unifier --> Validation
Physics --> Validation
Validation --> UnifiedEverything

note right of Domain
Reuse of one case-management representation
does not transport source-domain authority.
A target domain needs its own authority witness.
Named vendor identity does not create authority.
end note

note bottom of GovTOE
O/R/C/S/L/P/G/F frame.
ITIL, ISO 9000, ISO/IEC 42001/27001/27701/23894,
ISO 9241, NIST AI RMF, Six Sigma, and C4/PlantUML
are process lenses only.
No certification claim.
No ESD mutation.
end note
@enduml
